<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela to release reserve data Monday.</title>
<headline>Venezuela to release reserve data Monday.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuelan foreign reserves figures will be released Monday instead of the more usual Friday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>The Bank said technical problems had prevented them from compiling the weekly bulletin of macroeconomic indicators.</p>
<p>The bulletin would be ready Monday afternoon however, the Bank said.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
